# SideDock

An invisible, auto-hiding floating side dock for Windows 10/11 that stores copied text, screenshots, images, and PDFs locally on your PC.

## Install (Windows)
```bash
pip install git+[https://github.com/](https://github.com/)<saileshchikkam>/SideDock.git
